  "statement": "The GreenAgent highlights the necessity of sustainability in the bookkeeping system. Requirements GRN-01 and GRN-02 focus on minimizing energy consumption and reducing the carbon footprint, respectively, which are essential for environmentally responsible technology. GRN-03 emphasizes the importance of digitization to decrease paper use, while GRN-04 tracks the lifecycle impact of accounting features for continuous improvement. GRN-05 provides users with sustainability metrics, GRN-06 offers carbon offset options, and GRN-07 ensures compliance with relevant regulations, reinforcing the commitment to responsible practices.",
